    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jason and Medea are on a mission again: the famous relic collector Pelias asked them to retrieve the artifact that protects against Medusa's gaze. Without hesitation, the Argonauts set off on a journey to recover the artifact, save the cursed people, and find new friends. Explore the world, gather resources, and help the heroes lift the curse, using your time management skills and strategy to stop the curse and defeat the evil!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The storyline is based on ancient Greek mythology!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- New characters \u2013 Medusa the Gorgon and Asclepius!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Journey through ancient cities, mysterious forests, ruined temples, and even the secret laboratories of Asclepius!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Atmospheric, vibrant, and picturesque landscapes across all locations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique and creative track geometry on every level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Accessible tutorials to quickly master the basics of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Each set of locations introduces new gameplay mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Increased dynamics and engagement with two workers appearing almost at the start of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 50 levels of captivating and relaxing gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Updated graphics!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jason and Medea are on a mission again: the famous relic collector Pelias asked them to retrieve the artifact that protects against Medusa's gaze. Without hesitation, the Argonauts set off on a journey to recover the artifact, save the cursed people, and find new friends. Explore the world, gather resources, and help the heroes lift the curse, using your time management skills and strategy to stop the curse and defeat the evil!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The storyline is based on ancient Greek mythology!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- New characters \u2013 Medusa the Gorgon and Asclepius!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Journey through ancient cities, mysterious forests, ruined temples, and even the secret laboratories of Asclepius!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Atmospheric, vibrant, and picturesque landscapes across all locations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique and creative track geometry on every level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Accessible tutorials to quickly master the basics of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Each set of locations introduces new gameplay mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Increased dynamics and engagement with two workers appearing almost at the start of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 50 levels of captivating and relaxing gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Updated graphics!</p>",
